<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/founding-team-technical-founder-in-munich-ml-software-optimisation-plus-a> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#status> "active" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/founding-team-technical-founder-in-munich-ml-software-optimisation-plus-a> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteType> "correction" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/founding-team-technical-founder-in-munich-ml-software-optimisation-plus-a> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteText> "Founding team: technical founder in Munich (ML/software/optimisation) plus a Portuguese co-founder living in Portugal. Portugal and the Iberian MIBEL market therefore get first-market weight (local language, presence, network), alongside Germany/DACH. Two-country setup must be assessed: DE GmbH/UG vs PT Lda incorporation, cross-border selling, grants in both." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
